      "checked": "research/evidence/S0.1-env.txt:1-2,47,110,143,145,148,157 shows HOME, four XDG *_HOME variables, ACP_OMP_FOLD_DIR, ACP_LOG_FILE, PI_OPENAI_STATEFUL=0. This proves the listed injected values, not universal environment isolation."
