      "claim": "GATE 1 — observation probe returns undefined",
      "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
      "checked": "Archived probes/probe-seq.ts:50-78 reads/serializes event.payload without assigning to or mutating it and explicitly returns undefined after either successful capture or caught capture failure. Host runner.ts:1689-1691 only replaces currentPayload for a non-undefined handler result."
