    },
    {
      "claim": "Archive reproducibility — cited evidence preserved in repository",
      "verdict": "WRONG",
      "checked": "Archived directory has neither bodies/ nor final/, nor sandbox.env or home/.omp/agent/config.yml; it renames logs/handler-seq.log to handler-seq.log and home/.omp/acp-omp.json to sandbox-acp-omp.json. capture-index.tsv:1-13 contains 11 later hook entries and two final summaries, not original BASE/hook-pair bodies. Literal citations throughout S1-status.md:5,24-28,42 do not resolve in the archive. Body contents, tool calls, key sets for the final pair, canonical equality, and prefix preservation cannot be reconstructed from that index.",
      "defensible_wording": "The repository preserves a reduced summary archive, not the cited complete captures. Consult the renamed handler-seq.log and sandbox-acp-omp.json for those records. Later-run behavior details depend on non-archived live bodies; original BASE bodies and the final-pair hook captures have been deleted and are unavailable."
    },
    {
      "claim": "S0.4 — patch-chain baseline, mentioned in shared context but not a Closed table row",
      "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
      "checked": "S0.4-patch-check.txt:1-22 explicitly records OMP_PATCH_VERSION=18.1.10, the 20 APPLIED patch entries and the source-mode bin/omp link. This supports that captured baseline, not a later unchanged-chain comparison."
    }
